{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國佐治亞州亞特蘭大市正試圖提前阻止現實版「機械戰警」出現。當地市議會近日一致通過一項名為「HALT法案」（Human Authority over Lethal Technology，致命技術的人類控制權法案）的提案，計劃禁止市政府採購或使用具備武裝能力的自主機械人系統，確保涉及致命武力的決定始終由人類作出。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583232.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.960853+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:31:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"c1602f0c24d9f40e962bf033913bf74bc9946a70ad1c42bec05da2e68df7f184","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}